From 3b966a2ff929cd40b76a2efcae20e70ee899c21f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:56:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Build the core with Emscripten (wasm32)

- CMake: glslang only with Vulkan/OpenGL, allow 32-bit pointers on Emscripten,
  ZArchive needs <cstdlib>, ExceptionHandler stub, fontawesome via #embed
- ih264d: generic (non-SIMD) function selector and platform macros
- platform code: byteswap, clocks, _strcmpi/_BitScanReverse fallbacks,
  portable versions of _mm_pause/__rdtsc/_mm_mfence/_addcarry_u64
- flat_hash_map prime table uses 64-bit values even with 32-bit size_t
- no DSU (UDP) controller client, no thread names, platform name in log
